WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.233
I know a little about the history of Iran

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:18.000
because you made a course for LingQ

00:00:22.087 --> 00:00:28.295
which has 26 lessons about the history of Iran

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.133
I have studied this course

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:51.133
but we should study the same topic in different contexts several times

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:58.867
so that gradually we learn it and get better and better

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:08.700
So, from Greece to Central Asia

00:01:09.867 --> 00:01:23.067
and India, this region is very important culturally and historically

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:29.133
and a thousand years ago

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.867
Central Asia

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:37.967
used to be a cultural center

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:41.567
it was a center for science

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:54.200
while Europe had a lower level of culture and science

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.972
So, it's very interesting, Samarghand, Bukhara...

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:06.100
I have decided to start this challenge

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:13.533
this 90-days challenge

00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:23.133
to collect at least 400 coins every day

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:31.087
it's not difficult,

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:40.500
very quickly I can gain more than a thousand coins

00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:49.833
but I have two goals,

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:54.300
first, to collect more than 400 coins

00:02:56.767 --> 00:03:09.000
this is the default level

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:23.043
if I choose insane level, the highest number of coins is 400

00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:36.761
but usually I collect more than 1000 coins every day

00:03:36.767 --> 00:03:49.167
at the same time, I want to learn 50 new words every day

00:03:58.267 --> 00:04:16.787
in the past 2,3 days I managed to maintain this record

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:25.600
In language learning, the progress is very slow

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:33.687
I don't feel the progress

00:04:34.233 --> 00:04:46.933
but every day I keep listening and every day I find words I don't know or I know

00:04:50.067 --> 00:05:07.167
but if I see more and more blue and white words on my reader

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:15.033
it means I have made a progress

00:05:16.167 --> 00:05:43.019
and also on my stats, if the number of known words reaches 15000 it means progress has happened

00:05:43.667 --> 00:05:52.900
every morning I do my listening

00:05:55.133 --> 00:06:08.033
and I do my reading, sentence by sentence on LingQ

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:10.187
and I keep lingqing

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.600
my study time depends on my daily activities

00:06:20.633 --> 00:06:30.733
if we play golf with my wife

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.200
I don't find much time to study

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:46.433
So, in such days I study in the evening

00:06:47.433 --> 00:07:09.037
I may also study again what I have listened to earlier in the morning

00:07:11.567 --> 00:07:19.167
during your Persian learning, if for one day you switch to studying another language

00:07:20.033 --> 00:07:23.700
does this affect your Persian?

00:07:27.033 --> 00:07:28.033
it's interesting

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:51.100
I like to read a book in German before going to sleep

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.060
it doesn't affect

00:07:57.067 --> 00:08:05.123
because my level is high in German, there is no problem

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:20.400
when I listen to Persian

00:08:20.467 --> 00:08:24.667
or read

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.100
there is no problem

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:32.300
but when I try to speak Persian

00:08:32.433 --> 00:08:43.233
there is an influence from different other languages

00:08:44.633 --> 00:08:48.813
like Japanese... Russian

00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:58.513
I can't control my brain

00:08:59.667 --> 00:09:08.534
it all goes in the wrong direction

00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:16.700
but there is no problem when it comes to comprehension

00:09:17.733 --> 00:09:24.217
and sometimes there is the influence of Arabic language

00:09:24.233 --> 00:09:34.233
I wonder whether a word is Arabic...or it is Persian...

00:09:35.267 --> 00:09:37.987
but not a big issue

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:49.000
if I continue practicing my Persian the way I do now

00:09:49.633 --> 00:09:59.065
sometimes other languages affect the process, but not big a problem.

